    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38008" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαμπέχω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπᾰμοιβ-ίσχω</span></b>  (v. infr., cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπαμφίσκω</span>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put on over, overwrap,</i>
			
